test_cases.query:
I'm writing my first Agentic Data Plane access policy and adapted the example from `rpk ai policy create --help`:

permit(principal in Group::"support", action == Action::"dataplane_adp_mcpserver_tools_call", resource == McpServer::"servicenow");

Will this let the support group call tools on the servicenow MCP server?

